{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"◎乐十一（乐章五）","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"○祀岳镇海渎祀大火祀大辰","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"大中祥符五岳加帝号祭告八首","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"迎神，《静安》","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"钟石既作，俎豆在前。云旗飞扬，神光肃然。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"当驾飚欻，来乎青圆。言备缛礼，享兹吉蠲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"册入门，《正安》","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"节彼乔岳，神明之府。秩秩威仪，肃肃灵宇。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"懿号克崇，庶物咸睹。帝籍升名，式绥九土。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献东岳，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"节彼岱宗，有严庙貌。惟辟奉天，依神设教。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"帝典焜煌，嘉荐普淖。至灵格思，殊祥是效。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南岳","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"作镇炎夏，畜兹灵光。敷与万物，既阜既昌。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"爰刻温玉，式荐徽章。昭嘏神意，福熙穰穰。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西岳","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"瞻言太华，奠芳作镇。典册是膺，等威以峻。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"上公奉仪，祀宗荐信。介祉万邦，永配坤顺。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北岳","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"仰止灵岳，镇于朔方。增崇懿号，度越彝章。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祗荐嘉乐，式陈令芳。永资纯佑，国祚蕃昌。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"中岳","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"岩岩神岳，作镇中央。肃奉徽册，尊名孔章。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"聿降飚驾，载献兰觞。熙事允洽，宝祚弥昌。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《静安》","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祗荐鸿名，寅威明祀。有楚之仪，如在之祭。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠献既终，礼容克备。神鉴孔昭，福禧来暨。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"天安殿册封五岳帝一首","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"册出入，《正安》","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"名岳奠方，帝仪克举。吉日惟良，九宾咸旅。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"温玉镂文，纁裳正宁。礼备乐成，笃神之祜。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"熙宁望祭岳镇海渎十七首","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东望迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"盛德惟木，勾芒御神。沂岱淮海，厥功在民。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"爰熙坛坎，裒对庶神。于以歆格，灵贻具臻。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"升降，《同安》","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"绅韠衤詹兮，玉珮蕊兮。于我将事，神燕喜兮。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"帝命望祀，敢有不共。往返于位，肃肃雍雍。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祀以崇德，币则有仪。肃我将事，登降孔时。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"精明纯洁，罔有弗祗。史辞无愧，神用来娭。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"肇兹东土，含润无疆。维时发春，喜荐令芳。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祭用蒯薶沈，顺性含藏。不涸不童，诞降祺祥。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神之至止，熙坛为春。神之将归，旂服振振。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"欻兮回飚，窅兮旋云。祐于东方，永施厥仁。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南望迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"嵩嵇衡霍，暨厥海江。时维长养，惠我南邦。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"肆严牲币，神式来降。以侑以妥，百福是庞。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"景风应律，朱鸟开辰。肃肃明祀，嘉笾列陈。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"牲用牷物，乐奏蕤宾。克绥永福，祐此下民。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"鼓钟云云，龡管伊伊。神既醉饱，曰送言归。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"山有厚藏，水有灵德。物其永依，往奠炎宅。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"中望迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维土作德，维帝御行。含养载育，万物以成。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有严祀典，荐我德馨。神其歆止，永用亿宁。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"高广融结，实维中央。宣气报功，利彼一方。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"坎坛以祀，六乐锵锵。灵其有喜，酌以大璋。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"言旋其处，以奠中域。无替厥灵，四方是则。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神永不息，祀永不愆。以享以报，于万斯年。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西望迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"品物顺说，时司金行。于郊迎气，以望庶灵。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"雅歌维乐，圭荐惟牲。作民之祉，永相厥成。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西颢沆砀，执矩司秋。诹言协灵，时祀孔修。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"礼有荐献，爰视公侯。秩而祭之，百福是遒。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我乐我神，簋俎腥饔。曰神之还，西土是宫。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"于蕃禽鱼，于衍草木。富我薮隰，滋我高陆。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北望迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"帝德乘坎，时御闭藏，爰洁牷醴，兆兹北方。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"海山攸宅，神施无疆。具享蠲吉，降福孔穰。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"凄寒凝阴，陨箨涤场。百物顺成，黍稷馨香。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"款于北郊。爰因其方。何以侑神？荐此嘉觞。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维山及川，奠宅幽方。我度其灵，降止靡常。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"肃肃坎坛，既迎既将。促乐彻俎，是送是望。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"绍兴祀岳镇海渎四十三首","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东方迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"帝奠九壥，孰匪我疆。系我东土，山川相望。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祀事孔时，肃雍不忘。嶪峨濛鸿，郁哉洋洋！","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"初献盥洗，《同安》","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"青阳肇开，祀事孔饬。郁人赞溉，其馨苾苾。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"敬尔威仪，亦孔之则。神之格思，无我有斁。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"司历告时，惟孟之春。爰举时祀，旅于有神。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"鼓钟既设，珪帛具陈。阜蕃庶物，以福我民。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东岳位酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"岩岩天齐，自古在昔。肤寸之云，四方其泽。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"惟时东作，祀事乃饬。惠我无疆，恩沾动植。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东镇位","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"惟山有镇，雄于其方。东孰为雄？于沂之疆。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祀事有时，爰举旧章。我望匪遥，庶几燕飨。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东海位","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"澒洞鸿濛，天与无极。导纳江、汉，节宣南北。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"顺助其功，善下惟德。我祀孔时，以介景福。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东渎位","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我祀伊何？于彼长淮。导源桐柏，委注蓬莱。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"扞齐护楚，宣威示怀。豆笾列陈，亦孔之偕。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，酌献（四位并同）。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我祀孔肃，神其安留。容与裴回，若止若浮。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"洽此重觞，申以百羞。无我斁遗，万邦之休。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"蹇兮纷纷，神实戾止。以饮以食，以享以祀。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"〈日幼〉兮冥冥，神亦归止。以醉以饱，以锡尔祉。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南方迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"朱明盛长，我祀用饬。厥祀伊何？山川咸秩。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"如将见之，绳绳齐栗。神哉沛兮，消摇来格！","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"初献盥洗、升降，《同安》","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"爰熙嘉坛，揭虔毖祀。郁人沃盥，赞我稞事。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"于降于登，以作以止。莫不肃雍，告灵飨矣。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我祀我享，仪物孔周。一纯斯举，二精聿修。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"璞兮其温，丝兮其紑。是荐洁蠲，神兮安留。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南岳位酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神曰司天，居南之衡。位焉则帝，于以奠方。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南讹秩事，望礼有常。庶几嘉虞，介福无疆。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南镇位","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维南有山，于彼会稽。作镇在昔，神则司之。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"厥有旧典，以祀以时。百味维旨，灵其燕娭。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南海位","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维水善下，利物曰功。逶迤百川，谁欤朝宗？","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荡荡大受，于焉会同。膋萧列陈，以答鸿濛。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南渎位","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"四渎之利，经营中国。南曰大江，险兮天设。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维尔有神，隃其庙食。望秩孔时，我心翼翼。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，酌献","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神之游兮，洋洋对越。澹乎容与，肸蚃斯答。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"乃奏既备，八音攸节。重觞申陈，百礼以洽。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神（曲同迎神）","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荐彻豆笾，熙事备成。灵兮将归，羽旄纷纭。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"飘其逝矣，浮空薾云。怅然顾瞻，有抚怀心。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"中央迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"天作高山，屹然中峙。经营厥宇，万亿咸遂。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"火熙土王，爰举时祀。绳绳宣延，仿佛来止。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"初献盥洗、升降，《同安》","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"思来感格，肃雍不忘。礼仪既备，济济跄跄。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"洁蠲致敬，往荐其芳。交若有承，神兮孔飨。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"练日有望，高灵来下。何以告诚？心惟物假。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有篚斯实。有宝斯籍。于以奠之，神光烛夜。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"中岳位酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"与天齐极，伊嵩之高。显灵效异，神休孔昭。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"饬我祀事，实俎鸾膋。以侑旨酒，其馨有椒。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"中镇位","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"禹画九州，河内曰冀。霍山崇崇，作镇积势。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我祀如何？百末旨味。承神燕娭，诸神毕至。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，酌献","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"礼乐既成，肃容有常。奄留消摇。申毕重觞。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"仰胪所求，降福滂洋。师象山则，以氵兄皇章。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神（曲同迎神）","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"虞至旦兮，灵亦有喜。蹇欲骧兮，象舆已轙。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"粥音送兮，灵聿归矣。长无极兮，锡我以祉。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西方迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有岌斯安，有涵斯洽。聿相厥成，允祀是答。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"爰饬乃奏，乃奏既协。于昭降止，是遵是接。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"初献盥洗、升降，《同安》","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"靡实不新，靡陈不濯。人之弗蠲，矧敢将酌。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"载晞之帨，载濡之勺。洗仪告备，陟降时若。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"彼林有庪，彼泽有沈。猗与西望，弗菲弗淫。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"乃追斯邸，乃〈巾荒〉斯寻。卬礼既卒，是用是歆。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西岳位酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"屹削厥方，风云斯所。阴邑有宫，侐々俣俣。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"清酤在尊，灵昚在下。于俎献兮，则莫我吐。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西镇位","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维吴崇崇，于氵幵之西。瞻彼有陇，赫赫不迷。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"克裨于岳，我酌俶齐。于凡有旅，眡公维跻。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西海位","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奄浸坤轴，滋殖其濊。而典斯稽，有陛有壝。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"弗替时举，元斝斯酹。胡先于河？实委之会。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西渎位","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"自彼昆虚，于以潜流。念兹诞润，岂侯不犹。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"在昔中府，暨海聿修。迄既望止，神保先卣。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"肃肃其乂，既旨既溢。迨其毕酌，偏兹博硕。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祀事既遂，不敢谇射。神或醉止，我心斯怿。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神（曲同迎神）","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"乃羞既彻，乃奏及阕。无馂斯俎，式听致谒。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"不蹇不蹶，不沸不决。厉魃其祛，永庇有截。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北方迎神，《凝安》","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我土绵绵，孰匪疆理。惟时幽都，匪曰隃只。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"涤哉艮月，朔风其同！曷阻曷深，其亦来降。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"初献盥洗、升降，《同安》","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"寿宫煇煌，聿修时祀。缤其临矣，吉蠲以俟。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"居乎昂昂，行乎遂遂。敬尔攸司，展采错事。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"奠玉币，《明安》","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"相予阴威，厥功浩浩。一岁之功，何以为报？","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"府有珪币，我其敢私！肃肃孔怀，于以将之。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北岳位酌献，《成安》","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"瞻彼芒芒，曰北之常。既高既厚，乃纪乃纲。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荐鬯伊始，灵示孔将。玄服铁驾，览此下方。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北镇位","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"赫赫作镇，幽、朔之垂。兼福我民，食哉具宜。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"克配彼岳，有严等衰。蠲我灌礼，其敢不祗！","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北海位","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"八裔皆水，此一会同。澐々天墟，洞荡洪濛。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"至哉维坎，不有斯功！所秩伊何？黄流在中。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北渎位","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"水星之精，播液发灵。不胁于河，既介以清。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"翼翼盥荐，椒糈芬馨。载止载留，爰弭翠旌。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"俎豆纷披，金石繁会。侑以贰尊，匪渎匪怠。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我仪既周，我心孔戒。憺兮容与，仿佛如在。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神（曲同迎神）","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"灵既醉饱，礼斯彻兮。灵亦乐康，乐斯阕兮。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"云征飚举，不可尼兮。荐福锡祉，曷有极兮！","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"淳祐祭海神十六首","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"迎神，《延安》","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"宫一曲","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"堪舆之间，最钜惟瀛。包乾括坤，吐日滔星。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祀典载新，礼乐孔明。鉴吾嘉赖，来燕来宁。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"角一曲","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"四溟广矣，八纮是纪。我宅东南，回复万里。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"洪涛飚风，安危所倚。祀事特隆，神其戾止！","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"徵一曲","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"若稽有唐，克致崇极。祝号既升，爰增祭式。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"从享于郊，神斯受职。我祀肇新，式祈阴骘。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"羽一曲","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"猗与祀礼，四海会同！灵之来沛，鞭霆驭风。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"肸蚃仿佛，在位肃雍。佑我烝民，式徼神功。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"升降，《钦安》","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"灵之来至，垂庆阴阴。灵之已坐，饬兹五音。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"坛殿聿严，陟降孔钦。灵宜安留，鉴我德心。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东海位奠玉币，《德安》","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"百川所归，天地之左。氵项洞鸿濛，功高善下。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"行都攸依，百禄是荷。制币嘉玉，以侑以妥。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南海位奠玉币，《瀛安》","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"祝融之位，贵乎三神。吞纳江、汉，广大无垠。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"长为委输，祐我黎民。敬陈明享，允鉴恭勤。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西海位奠玉币，《润安》","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"蒲菖之泽，派引天潢。羲娥出入，浩渺微茫。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"盖高斯覆，犹隔封疆。我思六合，肇正吉昌。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北海位奠玉币，《瀚安》","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"瀚海重润，地纪亦归。吞受百渎，限制北陲。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"一视同仁，我心则怡。嘉荐玉币，神其格思。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"捧俎，《丰安》","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"昭格灵贶，祀典肇升。牲牷告充，雕俎是承。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荐虔效物，省德惟馨。灵其有喜，万宇肃澄。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"东海位奠酌献，《熙安》","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"沧溟之德，东南具依。熬波出素，国计攸资。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"石臼却敌，济我王师。神其享锡，益畀燕绥。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南海位酌献，《贵安》","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"南溟浮天，旁通百蛮。风樯迅疾，琛舶来还。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"民商永赖，坐消寇奸。荐兹嘉觞，弭矣惊澜。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"西海位酌献，《类安》","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"积流疏派，被于流沙。布润施泽，功均迩遐。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我秩祀典，四海一家。祗荐令芳，灵其享嘉！","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"北海位酌献，《溥安》","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"壝忽会同，裴回安留。牲肥酒香，晨事聿修。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"惟德之凉，曷奄九州？帝命是祗，多福自求。","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，《飨安》","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"笾豆有楚，贰觞斯旅。神其醉饱，式燕以序。","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"百灵秘怪，蜿蜒飞舞。锡我祺祥，有永终古。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《成安》","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"告灵飨矣，锡我嘉祚。乾端坤倪，开豁呈露。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"玄云聿收，群龙咸骛。减除凶灾，六幕清豫。","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"绍兴祀大火十二首","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"降神，《高安》","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"圜钟为宫","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"五纬相天，各率其职。司礼与视，则维荧惑。","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"至阳之精，届我长嬴。于以求之，祀事孔明。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"黄钟为角","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有出有藏，伏见靡常。相我国家，鉴观四方。","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"视罔不正，终然允臧。神其来格，明德馨香。","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"太簇为徵","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"小大率礼，不愆于仪。展采错事，秩祀孔时。","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维今之故，阅我数度。修厥典常，神其来顾！","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"姑洗为羽","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"于赫我宋，以火德王。永永丕图，繄神之相。","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神之来矣，维其时矣。礼备乐奏，神其知矣。","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_278","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"升殿，《正安》","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有俨其容。有洁其衷。屹屹崇坛，伊神与通。","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神肯降格，嘉神之休。虔恭降登，神乎安留。","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荧惑位奠玉币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"馨香接神，肸蚃恍惚。求神以诚，荐诚以物。","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有藉斯玉，有篚斯币。是用荐陈，昭兹精意。","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"商丘宣明王位奠币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荧惑在天，惟火与合。繄神主火，纯一不杂。","sentenceOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"作配荧惑，祀功则然。不腆之币，于以告虔。","sentenceOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_287","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"捧俎，《丰安》","sentenceOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"火遵其令，无物不长。视此牲牢，务得其养。","sentenceOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_289","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"豢以祀神，有腯其肥。非神之宜，其将曷归？","sentenceOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_290","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"荧惑位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_291","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"皇念有神，介我戩谷。登时休明，有此美禄。","sentenceOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_292","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"酌言献之，有飶其香。神兮燕娭，醉此嘉觞。","sentenceOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_293","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"宣明王位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_294","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"谁其祀神？知神嗜好。阏伯祀火，为神所劳。","sentenceOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_295","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"睠言配食，既与火俱。于乐旨酒，承神嘉虞。","sentenceOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_296","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，《文安》","sentenceOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_297","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神既贶施，嗜我饮食。申以累献，以承灵亿。","sentenceOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_298","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神方常羊，咸毕我觞，于再于三，于诚之将。","sentenceOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_299","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神用《理安》","sentenceOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_300","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"登降上下，奠璧献斝。音送粥粥，礼无违者。","sentenceOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_301","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"已虞至旦，神其将归。顾我国家，遗以繁厘。","sentenceOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_302","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"出火祀大辰十二首","sentenceOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_303","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"降神，《高安》","sentenceOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_304","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"圜钟为宫","sentenceOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_305","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"烨烨我宋，火德所畀。用火纪时，允惟象类。","sentenceOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_306","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神以类歆，诚繇类至。有感斯通，孚我阳燧。","sentenceOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_307","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"黄钟为角","sentenceOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_308","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"乐音上达，粤惟出虚。火性炎上，亦生于无。","sentenceOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_309","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"我镛我磬，我笙我竽。气同声应，昭哉合符！","sentenceOrder":309},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_310","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"太簇为徵","sentenceOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_311","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"火在六气，独处其两。感生维君，繄辰克相。","sentenceOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_312","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"何以验之？占兹垂象。腾驾苍虬，欻其来飨。","sentenceOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_313","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"姑洗为羽","sentenceOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_314","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"星入于戌，与火俱诎。火出于辰，与星俱伸。","sentenceOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_315","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"一伸一诎，孰操纵之？利用出入，民咸用之。","sentenceOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_316","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"升殿，《正安》","sentenceOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_317","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"屹彼嘉坛，赤伏始届。掞光耀明，洋乎如在。","sentenceOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_318","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"俯仰重《离》，默与精会。随我降升，肃听环珮。","sentenceOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_319","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"大辰位奠玉币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_320","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"维莫之春，五阳发舒。日之夕矣，三星在隅。","sentenceOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_321","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"莫量匪币，莫嘉匪玉。明荐孔时，神光下瞩。","sentenceOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_322","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"商丘宣明王奠币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_323","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"二七储神，与天地并。孰俪厥德？聿惟南正。","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_324","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"功楙陶唐，泽流亿姓。作配严禋，贽列惟称。","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_325","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"捧俎，《丰安》","sentenceOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_326","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有严在涤，陈彼牲牢。孔硕其俎，荐此血毛。","sentenceOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_327","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"厥初生民，饮茹则然。以燔以炙，伊谁云先？","sentenceOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_328","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"大辰位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_329","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"孰为大辰？维北有斗。曾是彗星，斯名孔有。","sentenceOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_330","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"幽荣报功，洁齐敢后。容与嘉觞，式歆旨酒。","sentenceOrder":330},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_331","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"宣明王位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":331},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_332","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"周设司爟，虽列夏官。仍袭孔易，闿端实难。","sentenceOrder":332},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_333","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"相彼商丘，永怀初造。不腆桂椒，匪以为报。","sentenceOrder":333},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_334","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，《文安》","sentenceOrder":334},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_335","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"潜之伏矣，柞槱既休。有俶其来，榆柳是求。","sentenceOrder":335},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_336","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"灵驾纷羽，尚其安留。饮我三爵，言言油油。","sentenceOrder":336},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_337","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《理安》","sentenceOrder":337},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_338","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"五运惟火，寔宗众阳。宿壮用明，千载愈光。","sentenceOrder":338},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_339","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神保聿归，安处火房。郁攸不作，炎图永昌。","sentenceOrder":339},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_340","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"纳火祀大辰十二首","sentenceOrder":340},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_341","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"降神，《高安》","sentenceOrder":341},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_342","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"圜钟为宫","sentenceOrder":342},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_343","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"赫赫皇图，炎炎火德。侈神之赐，奄有方国。","sentenceOrder":343},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_344","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"粢盛既丰，俎豆有飶。于万斯年，报祀无斁。","sentenceOrder":344},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_345","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"黄钟为角","sentenceOrder":345},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_346","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"火星之躔，有烨其光。表于辰位，伏于戌方。","sentenceOrder":346},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_347","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"时和岁稔，仁显用藏。告尔万民，出纳有常。","sentenceOrder":347},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_348","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"太簇为徵","sentenceOrder":348},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_349","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"季秋之月，律中无射。农事备收，火功告毕。","sentenceOrder":349},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_350","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"克禋克祀，有严有翼。风马云车，尚其来格！","sentenceOrder":350},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_351","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"姑洗为羽","sentenceOrder":351},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_352","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"明明我后，重祭钦祠。有司肃事，式荐晨仪。","sentenceOrder":352},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_353","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"礼惟其称，物惟其时。神之听之，福禄来为。","sentenceOrder":353},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_354","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"升殿，《正安》","sentenceOrder":354},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_355","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"猗与明坛，右平左墄！冕服斯皇，玉珮有节。","sentenceOrder":355},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_356","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"陟降惟寅，匪徐匪疾。式崇大祀，礼文咸秩。","sentenceOrder":356},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_357","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"大辰位奠玉币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":357},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_358","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"金行序晚，玉露晨清。齐戒丰洁。肃恭神明。","sentenceOrder":358},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_359","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"嘉币惟量，嘉玉惟精。于以奠之，庶几来听。","sentenceOrder":359},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_360","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"商丘宣明王位奠币，《嘉安》","sentenceOrder":360},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_361","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"恭惟火正，自陶唐氏。邑于商丘，配食辰祀。","sentenceOrder":361},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_362","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"有功在民，有德在位。敢替典常。惟恭奉币。","sentenceOrder":362},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_363","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"捧俎，《丰安》","sentenceOrder":363},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_364","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"万汇攸成，四方宁谧。工祝致告，普存民力。","sentenceOrder":364},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_365","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"乃荐斯牲。为俎孔硕。介以繁祉，式和民则。","sentenceOrder":365},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_366","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"大辰位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":366},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_367","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"庶功备矣，休德昭明。天地酿和，郁鬯斯清。","sentenceOrder":367},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_368","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"玉瓒以酌，瑶觞载盈。周流常羊，来燕来宁。","sentenceOrder":368},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_369","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"宣明王位酌献，《祐安》","sentenceOrder":369},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_370","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"广大建祀，式崇其配。馨香在兹，清酒既载。","sentenceOrder":370},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_371","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"穆穆在晖，洋洋如在。聿怀嘉庆，繄神之赍。","sentenceOrder":371},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_372","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"亚、终献，《文安》","sentenceOrder":372},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_373","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"币玉肃陈，笙簧具举。桂醑浮觞。琼羞溢俎。","sentenceOrder":373},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_374","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"礼有三献，式和且序。神具醉止，庆流寰宇。","sentenceOrder":374},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_375","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"送神，《理安》","sentenceOrder":375},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_376","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"神灵降鉴，天地回旋。惟馨荐矣，既醉歆焉。","sentenceOrder":376},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_377","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"诸宰斯彻，式礼莫愆。隤祉降祥，天子万年。","sentenceOrder":377},{"id":"s_work_tong_su_136_378","chapterId":"ch_work_tong_su_136","textTraditional":"《宋史》　元·脱脱等","sentenceOrder":378}],"overrides":{}}